Text\"><span style=\" \">React with most markers</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">React with most markers</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">React with &ge;&nbsp;2 markers</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 131.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"175\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">React with &ge;&nbsp;2&nbsp;markers; some cases may not react with any markers</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" \">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 141.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" color: black; \">Chromogranin</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 131.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"175\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">Diffuse (97%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">Diffuse (79%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">Focal (41%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 131.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"175\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">Focal (47%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" \">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 141.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" \">Synaptophysin</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 131.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"175\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Diffuse (97%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Diffuse (79%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Focal (69%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 131.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"175\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Focal (67%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" \">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 141.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" color: black; \">CD56</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 131.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"175\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">83%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">57%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">53%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 131.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"175\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">97%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" \">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 141.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" \">TTF1</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 131.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"175\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">~50%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">~50%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">~50%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 131.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"175\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">90%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.1pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" \">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 141.65pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" color: black; \">Ki-67</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 131.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"175\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">&lt;&nbsp;5%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">5&ndash;10%<sup>a</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">&gt;&nbsp;40%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 131.25pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"175\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">&gt;&nbsp;40%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">LCNEC, large cell neuroendocrine carcinoma; NE, neuroendocrine; SAPC, salt-and-pepper chromatin; SCNEC, small cell neuroendocrine carcinoma; TTF1, thyroid transcription factor&nbsp;1.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup><span style=\"\">a</span></sup><span style=\"\">Cases</span> with higher mitotic rate and Ki-67 proliferation index may occur and are currently classified as LCNEC.</p>",
